<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel gains on pulp price optimism.</title>
<headline>Portucel gains on pulp price optimism.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in pulp producer Portucel Industrial gained 1.8 percent to 1,099 escudos after a leading Swedish forestry group announced it might raise prices from mid-April, dealers said.</p>
<p>Sodra did not say by how much and it was not possible to get an immediate reaction from Portucel on its own price plans.</p>
<p>Portucel's stock was off early highs of 1,110 and was struggling to hold above 1,100. &quot;Maybe this time (pulp) prices will rise. But in the past there have been expectations for prices rises and then nothing happened,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>($1=168.39 escudos) --Lisboa Editorial, 351-1-3113125.</p>
